  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Graduation of Grantees and Cooperatives through Capacity Building in forging alliances for credit and business opportunitie s in Nicaragua (Graduacion)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asociacion Aldea Global Jinotega (Aldea Global) will train 18 farmers&apos; groups in administration and risk management, financial and credit delivery, internal governance, quality control, marketing, and how to improve gender equity among the board, staff, and beneficiaries. Aldea Global will provide credit, technical assistance and training to the cooperatives to improve their effectiveness as lenders and marketing outlets for small farmers. The eighteen groups have a membership of 1,800 who will benefit directly and their 9,000 family members will benefit indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
